    "name": "Anomalytics: From the Files of the Arcane Statistics Authority",
    "steam_appid": 2815800,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815800/extras/1920ce7debb657b3db9bd183792e6b3f.avif?t=1711907467\" width=616 height=150 /></span><br><br>As a newly-minted field agent of the Arcane Statistics Authority, delve into the concrete depths of abandoned logistics facilities, malicious start-ups, and redacted art exhibitions to log arcane phenomena. Armed with your trusty calculator and a trove of officially-sanctioned empirical equipment, prepare to combat the unknown<strong> ... by measuring it.</strong><br><br>Measure, tally, scan, transcribe, and wrangle your way through 15+ missions in career mode, or test your grit through an endless gauntlet of arcane assignments in overtime mode. Just beware - danger lurks around every corner, and your benefits don't include insurance. Will you rise through the ranks by mastering your numbers, or will you end up as <strong>... just another statistic?</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815800/extras/96622fb6fc5c26e9b6bf6ac5942a5745.poster.avif?t=1711907467\" width=430 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815800/extras/96622fb6fc5c26e9b6bf6ac5942a5745.webm?t=1711907467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815800/extras/96622fb6fc5c26e9b6bf6ac5942a5745.mp4?t=1711907467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Experience white-hot encoding excitement across story and roguelike modes<br></li><li>Try not to get fired amidst ever-escalating jobs and quality standards<br></li><li>Learn valuable time management and prioritization skills<br></li><li>Explore liminal spaces<br></li><li>Confront (run away from) mysterious entities<br></li><li>Enjoy the cubic confines of your own virtual office!</li></ul><br><strong>... and more, in the perilous and inscrutable future!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815800/extras/7b2364bfba131b78c0345ffa77de8a6a.avif?t=1711907467\" width=616 height=450 /></span>",
